AE Switch 0.1.0 is a modified version of uni-switch.
This modification's corresponding source and build materials are included in
the portable distribution under source/ae-switch/. The current source leaves
the target GitHub repository unset in app/release-config.json pending the
modification's actual repository. The upstream URLs and release statements in
the original notice below refer to uni-switch, not to this modification or an
AE Switch public release.

The AE Switch distribution does not include supported agent client binaries.
Users install those clients separately. Vendor marks and the UI runtime retain
their own ownership and notices; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

